6
00:18.850 --> 00:20.620
(to any real persons, places, organizations, or events.)

7
00:20.620 --> 00:21.760
(AI technology was used in certain scenes during production)

8
00:21.760 --> 00:22.410
(to help ensure safety during filming)

9
00:22.420 --> 00:23.020
(and to enhance the quality and realism of the visuals.)

10
00:23.710 --> 00:28.000
(Warning: Contains attempted suicide, blood, and violence.)

11
00:32.050 --> 00:33.150
Let's go find Chita.

12
00:35.420 --> 00:36.530
Then we'll end this together.

13
01:50.090 --> 01:55.140
=Nour= (WeTV Original)

14
02:05.280 --> 02:06.190
When did you get back?

15
02:07.170 --> 02:07.800
Last night.

16
02:10.320 --> 02:12.330
Everyone was looking for you last night. You know that?

17
02:15.680 --> 02:16.350
Mom.

18
02:17.970 --> 02:18.520
Mom.

19
02:18.520 --> 02:18.780
Nin.

20
02:19.190 --> 02:20.000
What's gotten into you?

21
02:20.470 --> 02:21.330
You'll scare Mom.

22
02:21.980 --> 02:23.320
Wait. When did you get back?

23
02:24.230 --> 02:25.290
You're back, sweetheart.

24
02:26.830 --> 02:28.330
When did you get back?

25
02:29.250 --> 02:30.600
Last night.

26
02:32.510 --> 02:34.100
Everyone was out looking for you last night.

27
02:34.640 --> 02:36.160
You're home. That's what matters.

28
02:37.260 --> 02:37.780
Come on.

29
02:38.160 --> 02:39.020
Let's eat.

30
02:39.210 --> 02:39.500
Come on.

31
02:50.660 --> 02:51.730
Eat some more, sweetheart.

32
02:52.400 --> 02:52.920
Thanks.

33
02:53.730 --> 02:55.160
You didn't come home last night.

34
02:55.420 --> 02:56.290
Where have you been?

35
02:56.710 --> 02:57.660
Were you with Chita?

36
02:58.990 --> 03:00.500
Yeah. Last night, I...

37
03:06.540 --> 03:07.190
Last night...

38
03:10.490 --> 03:11.680
I said goodbye to Chita.

39
03:16.640 --> 03:17.730
Did you get drunk and black out?

40
03:19.660 --> 03:20.120
Nin.

41
03:20.430 --> 03:21.910
Where does your brother drink?

42
03:22.910 --> 03:24.520
I won't mind if you have a drink once in a while.

43
03:26.010 --> 03:27.060
- Okay. - Eat up.

44
03:27.060 --> 03:28.530
Eat more. It'll make you stronger.

45
03:33.270 --> 03:33.760
Is it good?

46
03:47.170 --> 03:50.110
Oh, it just hit me.

47
03:50.110 --> 03:51.150
I have an unusual case.

48
03:51.840 --> 03:52.510
A special emergency case.

49
03:53.400 --> 03:53.970
Hurry and eat.

50
03:55.000 --> 03:56.130
All right.

51
04:05.470 --> 04:06.220
You're feeling better, right?

52
04:09.240 --> 04:10.900
I thought something happened to you.

53
04:12.270 --> 04:13.270
I'm right here.

54
04:13.890 --> 04:15.690
What could've happened? You're acting weird.

55
04:18.500 --> 04:19.640
Did the police catch Prae?

56
04:21.320 --> 04:21.980
Prae?

57
04:24.070 --> 04:24.980
I just...

58
04:25.720 --> 04:27.200
don't want to tell Mom about it.

59
04:28.460 --> 04:29.720
I'm afraid she'll get worse.

60
04:37.260 --> 04:38.300
You look out of it.

61
04:40.640 --> 04:41.430
Why are you acting so strange today?

62
04:42.360 --> 04:42.770
Uh...

63
04:53.510 --> 04:55.110
(Profile: Chidtawan) Our target is Chidtawan.

64
04:55.110 --> 04:57.190
He's our only lead right now.

65
04:57.600 --> 05:01.030
He's 27, tall, with a slim build.

66
05:01.280 --> 05:03.050
He walks with a limp.

67
05:04.660 --> 05:05.970
The target isn't an ordinary human.

68
05:06.540 --> 05:08.740
I want every unit to deploy all available personnel.

69
05:08.930 --> 05:10.280
If you spot him, don't hesitate.

70
05:10.620 --> 05:11.750
Arrest him immediately,

71
05:11.880 --> 05:13.270
and report to me right away.

72
05:16.160 --> 05:17.470
As for the killer being a Nour,

73
05:18.020 --> 05:19.520
keep it strictly confidential.

74
05:20.200 --> 05:21.380
- Yes, Inspector. - Yes.

75
05:22.070 --> 05:24.270
I've put every district on alert.

76
05:24.940 --> 05:27.160
Chidtawan knows we've identified him,

77
05:27.700 --> 05:28.800
so he may try to flee.

78
05:31.140 --> 05:32.210
Based on what we know,

79
05:33.290 --> 05:34.760
a Nour can only feed on blood.

80
05:35.870 --> 05:36.440
Officer Phong.

81
05:37.210 --> 05:38.770
I want you to go to the hospital.

82
05:39.890 --> 05:41.010
He might go there to steal blood.

83
05:43.530 --> 05:44.930
We're in position.

84
05:46.140 --> 05:48.180
Tangme, go to Chita's dorm.

85
05:48.640 --> 05:50.550
There's a good chance he'll return.

86
07:13.570 --> 07:14.000
Dr. Ji.

87
07:16.600 --> 07:17.150
What are you doing?

88
07:24.770 --> 07:25.590
Where did you go?

89
07:31.770 --> 07:32.920
What happened that night?

90
07:35.110 --> 07:36.540
Tell me everything.

91
07:41.010 --> 07:42.150
I don't remember anything.

92
07:44.340 --> 07:45.400
All I know is...

93
07:46.460 --> 07:47.830
I was saying goodbye to Chita.

94
07:51.480 --> 07:52.800
Then everything went blank.

95
07:56.250 --> 07:57.730
You're not hiding something

96
08:00.020 --> 08:01.050
to protect Chita, are you?

97
08:07.380 --> 08:08.290
Why would you say that?

98
08:10.220 --> 08:11.270
Why would I protect Chita?

99
08:16.110 --> 08:18.200
I'm asking why you'd say that.

100
08:23.310 --> 08:24.160
This is Prae's body.

101
08:25.950 --> 08:27.570
Chita burned her to death.

102
08:32.220 --> 08:34.030
What I've searched for all my life

103
08:36.230 --> 08:38.530
was beside you all along, Dr. Ji.

104
08:40.990 --> 08:41.920
How can you be sure?

105
08:42.600 --> 08:43.420
I saw it myself.

106
08:55.820 --> 08:56.820
I saw it myself.

107
08:56.820 --> 08:57.990
That's enough.

108
09:00.830 --> 09:01.540
Stop right there.

109
09:09.390 --> 09:10.720
I'll assume you didn't mean it.

110
09:14.470 --> 09:15.410
If you see him,

111
09:17.030 --> 09:18.340
tell me immediately.

112
09:19.710 --> 09:20.540
You know that, don't you, Doctor?

113
09:22.590 --> 09:25.480
I've spent my whole life searching for the Nour that can kill Nour.

114
09:53.200 --> 09:54.490
Dr. Ji looked shocked.

115
09:56.070 --> 09:57.200
I don't think he knew

116
09:57.600 --> 09:59.030
Chita was behind all of this.

117
10:02.030 --> 10:04.080
Either way, we need to keep watching Dr. Ji.

118
10:05.630 --> 10:07.320
Dr. Ji could be the wild card

119
10:08.310 --> 10:10.140
that leads us to Chita.

120
10:24.010 --> 10:25.890
I let you go in first on purpose.

121
10:27.680 --> 10:28.520
I wanted to know

122
10:30.570 --> 10:31.960
what you'd say to Dr. Ji.

123
10:35.010 --> 10:36.610
And it went exactly as I expected.

124
10:45.240 --> 10:46.210
All this time...

125
10:48.930 --> 10:49.910
I thought...

126
10:52.320 --> 10:53.650
you were happy with me

127
10:57.060 --> 10:58.730
and wanted to spend your life with me.

128
11:04.130 --> 11:06.430
But now I'm not sure

129
11:07.870 --> 11:08.870
whether what I believed

130
11:10.800 --> 11:11.720
was ever true.

131
11:21.730 --> 11:22.500
All this time...

132
11:26.030 --> 11:27.640
I really have been happy.

133
11:30.730 --> 11:31.500
Because of you.

134
11:39.300 --> 11:41.250
The life you see now

135
11:44.980 --> 11:46.570
isn't my real life.

136
11:50.680 --> 11:52.490
It was given to me by someone else.

137
11:56.600 --> 11:58.990
And I have to give it back to him.

138
12:09.390 --> 12:11.100
There's a place I'd like to show you.

139
12:15.910 --> 12:17.460
Hey, after the exam tomorrow,

140
12:18.280 --> 12:18.850
want to go grab a drink?

141
12:20.070 --> 12:21.290
All you think about is drinking.

142
12:21.630 --> 12:22.180
No.

143
12:22.270 --> 12:24.440
Come on. Music and dancing!

144
12:24.750 --> 12:26.180
No, I don't like it.

145
12:34.800 --> 12:35.800
It must be urgent.

146
12:36.150 --> 12:37.090
Go check upstairs.

147
12:37.410 --> 12:37.800
What?

148
14:27.400 --> 14:28.800
Ji! What are you doing? Let go!

149
14:30.330 --> 14:30.950
Let go! Stop!

150
14:30.950 --> 14:31.350
Nin!

151
14:31.460 --> 14:31.910
Nin, let go!

152
14:44.970 --> 14:46.050
Ji, what's wrong? Let go!

153
14:47.840 --> 14:48.450
Let go!

154
14:51.500 --> 14:51.920
Let go!

155
14:52.730 --> 14:54.170
Ji, let go! What's wrong with you?

156
14:55.640 --> 14:56.170
Nin!

157
14:56.270 --> 14:57.420
Let go of my friend, you monster!

158
14:58.380 --> 14:58.800
Ow!

159
14:59.580 --> 15:00.560
Nin, go!

160
15:00.700 --> 15:02.310
Nin! Nin, get outside!

161
15:03.840 --> 15:04.850
Hey! Let go!

162
15:05.290 --> 15:05.900
Nin!

163
15:06.450 --> 15:06.870
Let go!

164
15:07.080 --> 15:07.800
Nin!

165
15:07.850 --> 15:08.310
Get out!

166
15:08.730 --> 15:09.600
Let go of me!

167
15:09.600 --> 15:10.010
Get out!

168
15:10.170 --> 15:11.150
Ji, let go!

169
15:11.220 --> 15:11.860
Get out!

170
15:14.120 --> 15:15.670
What's wrong with you? Get out!

171
15:16.190 --> 15:17.800
I said get out!

172
15:20.900 --> 15:22.160
Go! Just go!

173
15:22.430 --> 15:24.090
- Go! Hurry! - I'm sorry, Nin.

174
15:24.550 --> 15:25.340
Nin, I didn't mean it.

175
15:28.530 --> 15:29.060
Nin.

176
15:29.060 --> 15:30.030
Nin, I'm sorry.

177
15:30.530 --> 15:31.150
Nin, I'm sorry.

178
15:55.220 --> 15:57.150
Nin, I'm sorry.

179
15:57.960 --> 15:59.090
Nin, I'm sorry.

180
16:21.830 --> 16:22.750
(Dr. Ji, is that you?)

181
16:30.150 --> 16:31.460
My true love is buried here.

182
16:33.270 --> 16:33.980
True love?

183
16:36.320 --> 16:37.460
I told you before, didn't I?

184
16:39.030 --> 16:40.380
About how to become a Nour.

185
16:41.130 --> 16:42.020
A Nour

186
16:43.180 --> 16:45.090
must bite through their true love's heart.

187
16:48.520 --> 16:50.110
But that isn't how I did it.

188
16:54.860 --> 16:56.190
All I could do...

189
16:58.510 --> 16:59.540
was to take his body

190
17:01.580 --> 17:03.540
and bury him here, at the source of the Chao Phraya River.

191
17:10.560 --> 17:12.790
A place we never had the chance

192
17:15.160 --> 17:16.420
to visit while he was alive.

193
17:18.410 --> 17:19.540
For other Nour,

194
17:21.600 --> 17:22.800
becoming Nour

195
17:24.000 --> 17:24.950
means staying with their true love

196
17:26.000 --> 17:28.010
for eternity.

197
17:29.800 --> 17:30.840
But for me...

198
17:32.350 --> 17:33.470
eternal life

199
17:34.670 --> 17:36.160
cost my true love his life.

200
17:42.530 --> 17:43.680
You might think

201
17:44.960 --> 17:45.710
eternal life

202
17:46.590 --> 17:47.400
is a gift.

203
17:49.490 --> 17:50.310
It isn't.

204
17:54.470 --> 17:55.540
In my life,

205
17:57.090 --> 17:58.160
I can't eat.

206
17:59.670 --> 18:00.710
I can't sleep.

207
18:02.260 --> 18:03.800
I can't even die when I want to.

208
18:06.370 --> 18:08.390
It feels more like a curse.

209
18:13.490 --> 18:15.090
The longer I live,

210
18:16.970 --> 18:18.430
I have to keep changing my name

211
18:19.470 --> 18:20.710
and taking on new identities,

212
18:22.900 --> 18:23.800
until sometimes...

213
18:25.320 --> 18:27.470
I even forget my own past.

214
18:31.260 --> 18:32.410
I forget who I am.

215
18:35.690 --> 18:36.490
And I forget...

216
18:38.190 --> 18:40.600
why I'm still living at all.

217
18:43.330 --> 18:45.900
All I can do is accept my fate,

218
18:47.410 --> 18:49.620
surviving on other people's blood,

219
18:51.110 --> 18:52.240
using someone else's name,

220
18:53.970 --> 18:55.180
living in someone else's home.

221
18:58.430 --> 19:00.970
Nothing in my life truly belongs to me.

222
19:08.920 --> 19:11.020
Do you understand what I want now?

223
19:14.390 --> 19:14.790
No.

224
19:16.500 --> 19:17.520
I never will.

225
19:19.390 --> 19:20.580
You think dying

226
19:21.310 --> 19:23.260
will repay the life you owe your true love?

227
19:27.530 --> 19:28.620
I'll make sure

228
19:29.840 --> 19:31.140
you see that living well

229
19:32.270 --> 19:33.400
is how you'll find peace

230
19:33.980 --> 19:36.250
and break free from the curse and everything haunting you.

231
19:59.760 --> 20:00.660
Let me check the wound.

232
20:03.870 --> 20:04.490
Whoa.

233
20:05.340 --> 20:06.450
It's bleeding through.

234
20:07.070 --> 20:07.920
Want a new bandage?

235
20:08.570 --> 20:09.120
I'm fine.

236
20:12.750 --> 20:13.810
Fine. Suit yourself.

237
20:17.500 --> 20:17.970
By the way,

238
20:19.030 --> 20:19.950
where's your mom?

239
20:21.660 --> 20:23.140
She went upstairs to sleep.

240
20:25.860 --> 20:27.280
Luckily, she was out earlier.

241
20:28.270 --> 20:30.960
When she came back, I lied and said my brother had an emergency.

242
20:31.420 --> 20:32.230
You lied to your mom?

243
20:34.680 --> 20:35.370
Yeah.

244
20:40.430 --> 20:41.290
Let me ask you something.

245
20:43.390 --> 20:44.810
What will you do about your brother?

246
20:51.150 --> 20:51.670
Honestly...

247
20:54.220 --> 20:54.800
right now...

248
20:57.500 --> 20:58.320
I'm terrified.

249
21:02.260 --> 21:02.920
You saw him.

250
21:04.310 --> 21:05.830
You saw what he was like.

251
21:07.360 --> 21:08.510
But what scares me more

252
21:10.130 --> 21:10.700
is that...

253
21:13.260 --> 21:14.480
I'll never be able to see him the same way again.

254
21:17.800 --> 21:20.680
If my brother starts killing people

255
21:21.640 --> 21:23.170
or drinking people's blood...

256
21:26.990 --> 21:28.280
how can I still see him as my brother?

257
21:29.390 --> 21:30.280
And then there's Mom.

258
21:31.950 --> 21:33.040
She'd never be able to handle it.

259
21:35.050 --> 21:37.980
My brother means everything to her.

260
21:41.680 --> 21:42.810
Just answer one question.

261
21:44.710 --> 21:45.690
Do you still love your brother?

262
21:47.070 --> 21:47.450
Of course.

263
21:49.170 --> 21:49.820
Exactly.

264
21:51.880 --> 21:53.720
Love is stupid like that.

265
21:54.180 --> 21:55.740
Even after what he's done,

266
21:56.350 --> 21:57.350
you still love him.

267
21:58.360 --> 22:01.540
Love and reason will always be at odds.

268
22:02.410 --> 22:04.620
You saw how hard he tried, right?

269
22:05.600 --> 22:07.180
He fought hard to keep himself

270
22:08.240 --> 22:09.130
from biting you.

271
22:11.140 --> 22:11.680
Exactly.

272
22:12.280 --> 22:13.500
That alone proves

273
22:13.800 --> 22:14.820
he's still trying.

274
22:16.020 --> 22:17.020
And that same faith,

275
22:17.990 --> 22:19.630
I hope you can hold on to it too.

276
22:20.790 --> 22:22.720
You have to believe he can become himself again.

277
22:25.950 --> 22:26.960
But don't put too much pressure on yourself.

278
22:29.440 --> 22:31.060
No matter what happens next,

279
22:32.830 --> 22:34.190
the person who'll stay by your side

280
22:34.890 --> 22:35.430
will be me.

281
22:38.120 --> 22:39.110
You can count on that.

282
22:40.000 --> 22:40.420
Yeah.

283
22:41.010 --> 22:42.080
I promise.

284
22:44.360 --> 22:45.030
Thanks, man.

285
22:47.490 --> 22:48.240
Let's deal with that wound.

286
22:50.320 --> 22:52.160
No bandages, though. Want me to spit on it?

287
22:53.380 --> 22:54.280
Not the time for jokes.

288
23:01.190 --> 23:02.990
Phong sent people to Chita's dorm.

289
23:03.110 --> 23:04.430
Dr. Jirat came here looking for him.

290
23:19.420 --> 23:20.380
What did you do to me, Chita?

291
23:21.280 --> 23:21.640
Doctor.

292
23:24.420 --> 23:25.390
- Dr. Ji. - What did you do to me?

293
23:36.480 --> 23:37.860
Tell me. What did you do to me?

294
23:37.860 --> 23:38.620
Doctor, listen to me.

295
23:40.820 --> 23:41.530
Doctor.

296
23:42.870 --> 23:44.050
We can't stay here, Doctor.

297
23:46.070 --> 23:46.900
We have to leave.

298
23:49.900 --> 23:50.830
I'm not going anywhere.

299
23:52.430 --> 23:54.020
First tell me what happened.

300
24:01.500 --> 24:02.610
Calm down.

301
24:04.190 --> 24:05.540
We have to leave, Doctor.

302
24:15.640 --> 24:16.220
Chita.

303
24:18.240 --> 24:19.040
Do you know...

304
24:21.190 --> 24:22.930
I almost killed my brother today?

305
24:38.880 --> 24:39.660
Tell me the truth.

306
24:42.800 --> 24:44.130
You were already dead back then.

307
24:51.090 --> 24:52.230
See you tomorrow, Chita.

308
24:53.230 --> 24:53.790
See you tomorrow.

309
24:55.640 --> 24:57.280
When we said goodbye that day,

310
24:59.930 --> 25:01.880
Prae must've been chased here.

311
25:02.680 --> 25:03.620
She was injured.

312
25:04.310 --> 25:05.770
And she happened to run into you.

313
25:22.200 --> 25:23.800
I was just a step too late.

314
25:24.200 --> 25:26.680
It's all my fault.

315
25:27.400 --> 25:28.680
I didn't get here in time to save you.

316
25:59.160 --> 25:59.600
Doctor.

317
27:24.240 --> 27:24.680
Doctor.

318
27:40.730 --> 27:41.840
No.

319
27:42.620 --> 27:42.980
Doctor.

320
27:47.220 --> 27:48.640
I don't want to lose you.

321
27:49.220 --> 27:50.680
I had no choice.

322
27:53.170 --> 27:54.950
So I decided to change you.

323
28:36.660 --> 28:38.460
Doctor.

324
28:42.030 --> 28:43.290
Wake up!

325
29:03.420 --> 29:04.950
But you still didn't wake up.

326
29:06.550 --> 29:08.130
At first, I thought it hadn't worked.

327
29:09.930 --> 29:12.480
I was afraid we weren't each other's true love.

328
29:13.060 --> 29:14.730
Doctor, wake up!

329
31:06.130 --> 31:06.580
Chita.

330
31:08.590 --> 31:09.000
Chita.

331
31:35.400 --> 31:36.170
But look.

332
31:37.590 --> 31:38.490
You're with me now.

333
31:42.070 --> 31:43.820
Because we're each other's true love.

334
31:49.010 --> 31:49.590
Chita.

335
31:51.700 --> 31:52.990
So you killed all those people.

336
31:54.060 --> 31:55.020
You killed Somying.

337
31:55.760 --> 31:56.500
You killed Tee.

338
31:57.400 --> 31:58.200
You killed Prae.

339
31:59.860 --> 32:00.470
Didn't you?

340
32:06.740 --> 32:07.440
They were all Nour.

341
32:11.710 --> 32:12.880
They deserved to die, Doctor.

342
32:17.300 --> 32:18.410
Then kill me too.

343
32:20.670 --> 32:21.570
I'm Nour too.

344
32:27.590 --> 32:28.630
You're different.

345
32:31.350 --> 32:32.130
You know...

346
32:32.780 --> 32:34.030
I'd never hurt you.

347
32:40.310 --> 32:41.260
Doctor.

348
32:42.690 --> 32:43.420
Come with me.

349
32:46.070 --> 32:46.400
No.

350
32:48.550 --> 32:49.120
Please, Doctor.

351
32:52.220 --> 32:52.670
Doctor.

352
32:53.840 --> 32:54.450
Let me go.

353
32:55.240 --> 32:55.800
Let me go!

354
32:55.860 --> 32:57.130
Doctor! Listen to me!

355
32:58.920 --> 32:59.440
Doctor.

356
33:00.300 --> 33:00.580
Let go!

357
33:00.700 --> 33:01.550
Doctor! Doctor!

358
33:05.820 --> 33:06.890
Doctor, don't go!

359
33:06.890 --> 33:08.150
Please listen to me.

360
33:08.400 --> 33:08.890
Doctor.

361
33:22.130 --> 33:22.540
Doctor.

362
33:25.220 --> 33:26.140
Doctor! Doctor!

363
33:33.600 --> 33:34.730
Doctor!

364
33:56.710 --> 33:57.490
Where is everyone?

365
33:58.200 --> 33:59.160
(People's Police Station) Tangme's car is gone too.

366
34:00.280 --> 34:02.380
(People's Police Station) Wait here. I'll go upstairs for my gun.

367
34:22.700 --> 34:24.300
(Can anyone hear me? Can anyone hear me?)

368
34:25.530 --> 34:26.180
What's wrong, Officer Phong?

369
34:26.480 --> 34:27.240
James, where are you?

370
34:27.430 --> 34:28.280
Tangme already went inside.

371
34:28.470 --> 34:29.410
(Repeat, Tangme is already inside.)

372
34:29.840 --> 34:31.010
Tell Tangme not to go in.

373
34:31.540 --> 34:32.530
I'm on my way.

374
34:42.650 --> 34:44.690
(People's Police Station)

375
36:00.400 --> 36:01.000
Dr. Jirat.

376
36:06.420 --> 36:07.150
Dr. Jirat.

377
36:08.550 --> 36:09.400
Are you okay?

378
36:11.800 --> 36:12.710
Doctor, can you hear me?

379
36:14.220 --> 36:14.980
Doctor, what's wrong?

380
36:17.820 --> 36:18.320
Doctor.

381
36:18.420 --> 36:19.550
Stay with me, Doctor.

382
36:19.550 --> 36:20.430
Doctor.

383
36:20.430 --> 36:21.690
Dr. Ji! Doctor!

384
36:21.840 --> 36:22.650
Doctor.

385
36:42.820 --> 36:44.000
Don't shoot him.

386
36:45.640 --> 36:47.000
He's not complete yet.

387
36:48.660 --> 36:50.020
He could die.

388
36:50.880 --> 36:51.700
Sorry about this.

389
40:23.930 --> 40:24.750
Doctor.

390
40:30.440 --> 40:31.450
Let's live together.

391
40:33.780 --> 40:35.320
You wanted to go abroad, right?

392
40:38.990 --> 40:39.880
Let's go together.

393
40:54.800 --> 40:55.510
Doctor.

394
40:57.000 --> 40:57.820
How can I?

395
41:00.970 --> 41:01.970
What about my family?

396
41:05.150 --> 41:06.270
Like I told you,

397
41:07.460 --> 41:08.640
once you've adjusted,

398
41:10.260 --> 41:11.160
we'll come back.

399
41:12.990 --> 41:14.820
When everything settles down,

400
41:17.340 --> 41:19.310
I'll find a way to help you adjust to this life.

401
41:21.830 --> 41:23.480
You don't have to be afraid when you're with me.

402
41:33.890 --> 41:36.240
Why are you looking at me like that?

403
41:38.150 --> 41:38.650
Doctor.

404
41:40.220 --> 41:40.950
I'm scared.

405
41:45.640 --> 41:46.400
Of what?

406
41:49.000 --> 41:49.680
I'm scared.

407
41:52.480 --> 41:53.290
What are you scared of?

408
41:53.300 --> 41:54.350
I'm really scared of you.

409
41:59.730 --> 42:00.660
Why would you say that?

410
42:02.540 --> 42:03.850
I'm scared of myself too.

411
42:07.070 --> 42:08.130
I hate myself.

412
42:09.990 --> 42:10.770
No, no, no.

413
42:11.950 --> 42:13.890
Don't be afraid. You're with me now.

414
42:15.970 --> 42:17.160
Look at what you've done.

415
42:22.160 --> 42:23.220
Just look.

416
42:26.340 --> 42:27.530
You think you're helping me?

417
42:28.840 --> 42:29.550
I was only trying...

418
42:29.880 --> 42:31.270
I really was trying to help you.

419
42:33.550 --> 42:34.420
But you killed me.

420
42:35.440 --> 42:36.810
Do you understand? You killed me.

421
42:38.580 --> 42:39.220
Chita.

422
42:42.640 --> 42:43.210
I...

423
42:45.880 --> 42:46.740
gave everything I had

424
42:50.240 --> 42:51.060
to become a doctor,

425
42:52.520 --> 42:53.550
to save lives.

426
42:56.730 --> 42:58.500
If I become a killer like you,

427
43:01.050 --> 43:03.000
I'd rather be dead.

428
43:05.030 --> 43:05.450
Why?

429
43:08.960 --> 43:09.950
Why would you say that?

430
43:12.110 --> 43:13.100
I want to die.

431
43:15.700 --> 43:18.560
You can't die. You must stay with me.

432
43:19.280 --> 43:21.050
You can't die!

433
43:22.620 --> 43:23.190
Doctor.

434
43:52.930 --> 43:53.430
Doctor.

435
43:54.930 --> 43:56.320
Doctor! Doctor!

436
43:56.850 --> 43:58.150
Doctor, what happened?

437
44:01.140 --> 44:01.700
Doctor.

438
44:04.820 --> 44:05.830
Have you seen Tangme?

439
44:07.050 --> 44:07.940
The female officer.

440
44:09.000 --> 44:10.830
The one who works with Inspector Ken and me.

441
44:13.680 --> 44:14.560
Have you seen her?

442
44:16.670 --> 44:17.530
Tangme?

443
44:18.130 --> 44:18.720
Tangme?

444
44:19.480 --> 44:19.880
Tangme?

445
44:20.810 --> 44:21.380
Tangme?

446
44:24.270 --> 44:25.050
Doctor, what happened?

447
44:27.290 --> 44:27.760
Tangme?

448
44:28.680 --> 44:29.230
Tangme?

449
44:29.240 --> 44:30.150
What's all this blood?

450
44:31.110 --> 44:31.760
Tangme?

451
44:34.490 --> 44:35.140
I didn't do it.

452
44:35.800 --> 44:36.670
- What did you do? - I...

453
44:36.670 --> 44:37.170
I didn't do it.

454
44:37.800 --> 44:38.280
It wasn't me.

455
44:39.140 --> 44:39.790
What did you do?

456
44:40.320 --> 44:41.000
It wasn't me.

457
44:41.420 --> 44:42.040
I didn't do it.

458
44:42.660 --> 44:44.050
What do you mean, it wasn't you? Answer me!

459
44:52.550 --> 44:53.140
Tangme.

460
44:53.560 --> 44:53.960
Tangme.

461
44:54.110 --> 44:55.540
Hey, Tangme!

462
44:55.540 --> 44:56.950
Get up!

463
44:57.880 --> 44:59.470
Someone help us!

464
44:59.990 --> 45:01.590
Hey! We need help!

465
45:05.610 --> 45:07.460
(Tangme! Tangme!)

466
45:07.460 --> 45:08.970
(Tangme, no!)

467
45:10.790 --> 45:11.510
Tangme is dead.

468
45:13.050 --> 45:13.840
Tangme is dead.

469
45:17.770 --> 45:20.130
(James, where are you? Come help me!)

470
45:21.150 --> 45:23.330
(James, where are you?)

471
45:23.330 --> 45:25.330
(Tangme!)

472
45:46.880 --> 45:48.120
Chita did this, didn't he?

473
45:49.630 --> 45:51.230
That Chita guy did this, didn't he?

474
45:52.360 --> 45:53.450
Or was it you, Doctor?

475
45:55.910 --> 45:57.360
I need to know who to stab.

476
46:02.930 --> 46:03.620
Doctor, run!

477
46:03.710 --> 46:04.080
Chita!

478
46:04.540 --> 46:05.260
- Doctor, run! - Chita!

479
46:05.510 --> 46:05.900
Chita!

480
46:06.830 --> 46:07.140
Chita!

481
46:24.180 --> 46:25.230
You did it, didn't you?

482
46:26.500 --> 46:27.360
She shouldn't have come in.

483
46:29.690 --> 46:30.600
This isn't what I wanted.

484
46:45.780 --> 46:46.630
This one's for Tangme.

485
47:15.240 --> 47:15.970
And this one...

486
47:16.640 --> 47:17.800
