487
47:30.420 --> 47:31.020
Doctor.

488
47:32.040 --> 47:33.020
I'm sorry.

489
48:05.940 --> 48:10.570
♪In a love that can never be real♪

490
48:12.840 --> 48:17.670
♪You gaze in my soul and share what I feel♪

491
48:20.040 --> 48:24.800
♪Gray days all fade away, I'm healed♪

492
